# Grade 3/4 Photo Gallery

Add student work and classroom photos here.

## Naming Convention
Use descriptive names like:
- `2026-01-art-project.jpg`
- `winter-carnival-2026.jpg`
- `science-fair-display.jpg`

## Image Guidelines
- Recommended size: 800x600 pixels or larger
- Format: JPG or PNG
- Keep file sizes under 500KB for fast loading
